representable by algebraic spaces. Then the following are equivalent
\begin{enumerate}
\item $f$ is separated,
\item $\Delta_f$ is a closed immersion,
\item $\Delta_f$ is proper, or
\item $\Delta_f$ is universally closed.
\end{enumerate}

